{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeDihedralBraidReduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeDihedralBraidReduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeDescentQuadratic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic"],"declarations":29,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_minus_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_minus_star","kind":"theorem","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L237-L247","doc":"**ρ-equivariance of the e₋ channel.** Together with `channel_plus_star`\nthe full channel pair is ρ-equivariant at every rank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_plus_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_plus_star","kind":"theorem","line":220,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L220-L235","doc":"**ρ-equivariance of the e₊ channel (B1 dictionary, module level)**:\nconjugation carries the e₊ channel vector at `q` to the e₊ channel vector\nat `star q` of the conjugated state — at every rank. On the fibre circle\n`|q| = 1` one has `star q = q⁻¹`, so this says the bar-involution\n`ρ : q ↦ q⁻¹` and complex conjugation implement the SAME move on the\nchannel data: `F ∘ ρ = conj ∘ F` at the module level, the algebraic twin\nof the geometric `deck_eigenspace_exchange` (T3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_star","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L211-L218","doc":"**Conjugation intertwines the generator action with `h ↦ star h`**:\n`star ∘ σ(h) = σ(star h) ∘ star`, entrywise, at every rank. The descent\ntest is real (a length comparison), so conjugation passes straight\nthrough the length rule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.dihedralSelf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.dihedralSelf","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L193-L205","doc":"The n = 3 self-instance: `W = Fin 6` with the trivial coset space —\nthe datum is non-vacuously inhabited, and `braid_of_dihedral` re-derives\nthe concrete n = 3 braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.braid_of_dihedral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.braid_of_dihedral","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L167-L189","doc":"**THE BRAID RELATION AT GENERAL RANK, from the coset datum**:\n`σᵢσⱼσᵢ = σⱼσᵢσⱼ` on any descent module carrying a dihedral coset\nstructure. The proof localizes to the fibres (three applications of the\nrestriction lemmas) and closes with the proved n = 3 cell braid — the\nMatsumoto reduction, formalized: the general braid's entire remaining\ncontent is the existence of the coset datum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.cell_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.cell_braid","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L159-L165","doc":"The braid relation on the cell, in `mulStep` form — the merged\n`H3.braid_operator` transported through the table bridges. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.restrict_j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.restrict_j","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L148-L157","doc":"**Cell-restriction of the second generator's action.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.restrict_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.restrict_i","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L139-L146","doc":"**Cell-restriction of the first generator's action**: over a fixed\ncoset, `mulStep S.Di` IS the proved n = 3 σ₀ action on the fibre. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len_symm","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L134-L137","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj_symm","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L128-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti_symm","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L122-L126","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.fib","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.fib","kind":"def","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L119-L120","doc":"The fibre restriction of a state: the cell values over a fixed coset. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj_len","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj_len","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L117-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj_t","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L116-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di_len","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di_len","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L115-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di_t","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L114-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Dj","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L100-L112","doc":"The second generator's descent structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.Di","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L85-L98","doc":"The first generator's descent structure, induced from the cell tables\n(involution and rank-toggle inherited from the `decide`-checked\n`descentH3σ₀`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj_eq","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The second generator acts cell-wise by the proved σ₁ table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti_eq","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L77-L77","doc":"The first generator acts cell-wise by the proved σ₀ table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len_add","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Length additivity along the cell: `ℓ(u₀·d) = ℓ(u₀) + ℓ_D(d)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.tj","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Step map of the second generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.ti","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Step map of the first generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len0","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L69-L69","doc":"The length of the minimal coset representative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.len","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The global length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.equiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.equiv","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The parabolic factorization `W ≃ C × (S₃ cell)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.C","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The coset space (minimal-coset-representative labels). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DihedralCosetStructure","kind":"structure","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDihedralBraidReduction.lean#L54-L79","doc":"**Dihedral (order-3 pair) coset structure**: the parabolic factorization\ndatum for an adjacent generator pair. `W` factors as `C × Fin 6` (coset\nspace × the S₃ cell in the merged NF order `[γ, σ₀, σ₁, L₊, L₋, e⁻]`),\nlengths are additive along the cell, and the two step maps act cell-wise by\nthe proved n = 3 tables (`descentH3σ₀.t`, `descentH3σ₁.t`). Every Coxeter\nsystem carries one for each adjacent pair by the standard parabolic coset\ndecomposition — that fact is the isolated open combinatorial input. ","signatureChunk":0}]}